with played jamming spiders and spiders spiders from jamming guitar good from guitar été from mars played played spiders guitar ziggy gilly guitar played gilly good été mars gilly good good with gilly jamming from gilly with good ziggy ziggy gilly played weird weird mars mars jamming guitar mars from gilly été jamming guitar good été with from été good été weird été guitar weird from guitar été spiders weird and from gilly and été with from played weird guitar and weird spiders jamming ziggy from guitar from gilly good good spiders gilly weird weird good jamming and été weird weird mars spiders from spiders guitar été and spiders weird ziggy spiders played été guitar guitar été ziggy gilly played from from weird from guitar guitar and with gilly weird good spiders été played with from jamming gilly guitar weird from mars été été gilly jamming played guitar jamming from gilly with and good spiders and guitar ziggy good mars jamming"

# The preset dictionary `ZLIB_DICT` was made with: the text's first 200 bytes.
constant DICTIONARY_LEN: i64
    200

# A raw stream made by hand (type3); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid block type.
constant RAW_TYPE3: str
    "07"

# A raw stream made by hand (stored_nlen); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid stored block lengths.
constant RAW_STORED_NLEN: str
    "0105000000"

# A raw stream made by hand (stored_cut); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -5 while decompressing data: incomplete or truncated stream.
constant RAW_STORED_CUT: str
    "010500faff6162"

# A raw stream made by hand (lit286); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid literal/length code.
constant RAW_LIT286: str
    "1b03"

# A raw stream made by hand (dist30); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid distance code.
constant RAW_DIST30: str
    "4b043e"

# A raw stream made by hand (too_far); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid distance too far back.
constant RAW_TOO_FAR: str
    "4b044200"

# A raw stream made by hand (far_first); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid distance too far back.
constant RAW_FAR_FIRST: str
    "030200"

# A raw stream made by hand (fixed_ok); Python's zlib: accepts, 4 bytes out.
constant RAW_FIXED_OK: str
    "4b040200"

# A raw stream made by hand (dyn_ok); Python's zlib: accepts, 1 bytes out.
constant RAW_DYN_OK: str
    "05e0050900000000206cf5ff0915"

# A raw stream made by hand (cl_oversubscribed); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid code lengths set.
constant RAW_CL_OVERSUBSCRIBED: str
    "05e08104000000001000"

# A raw stream made by hand (cl_incomplete); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid code lengths set.
constant RAW_CL_INCOMPLETE: str
    "05e00109000000002000"

# A raw stream made by hand (lit_incomplete); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid literal/lengths set.
constant RAW_LIT_INCOMPLETE: str
    "05e0010900000080206cadff239200"

# A raw stream made by hand (repeat_first); Python's zlib: refuses: Error -3 while decompressing data: invalid bit length repeat.
constant RAW_REPEAT_FIRST: str
